Other interactions:
* {{dlc+|nr}}{{i|Chocolate Milk}}: Doesn't increase damage, but reduces Isaac's tear delay by 20%.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Epic Fetus|na}}: Overridden by Epic Fetus.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Guillotine}}: The knife is fired from the body, not from the head.
* {{i|Haemolacria|a+nr}}: Both apply normally; the tears down negatively affects Mom's Knife's charge time.
* {{i|Isaac's Tears}}:
** {{dlc|na+}} The item fires normal tears, although it will charge nearly instantly while the attack charges.
** {{dlc|a+nr}} Fires normal tears. Charges at the same rate as Isaac's fire rate while charging Mom's Knife.
** {{dlc|r}} Fires normal tears. Charges when firing Mom's Knife.
* {{i|Saturnus}}: No effect for orbiting tears.
* {{i|Tammy's Head}}: Fires 10 knives in a circle around Isaac, doesn't add Tammy's Head's flat damage bonus.
* {{i|Tiny Planet}}: The knife goes in a spiral around Isaac; the longer the knife is charged, the bigger the spiral. {{dlc|nr}} Not recommended, as this makes Mom's Knife almost impossible to aim.
** {{dlc|r}} Launched knife will orbit Isaac incredibly fast with a much larger hitbox, dealing consistent damage and covering every side of Isaac.
** Items that fire knives out in a straight line, like {{i|Brimstone}} or {{i|Monstro's Lung}}, will cause the knives to circle around Isaac once, then shoot out in the intended direction in a straight line.
* {{I|Tractor Beam}}: The knife will snap to whichever direction Isaac is firing in after it's thrown. However, it can no longer be fired diagonally.

