== Bugs ==
{{Bug|{{i|Tiny Planet}} and [[Tear Effects#Homing|Homing tears]] may cause a visual bug when there is a high range. This makes it look like the knife is going in circles when it's not rotating around the body.}}
{{Bug|With {{i|Tiny Planet}}, if Isaac releases the knife and exits the room before it returns to him, the knife will receive a significantly larger hitbox that scales with Isaac's [[Range]]. Releasing it and waiting until it returns will make it normal again.}}
{{bug|dlc=a+nr|Using Mom's Knife and {{i|Marked}} with {{i|Haemolacria}} will cause the latter to only fire towards the center of room. Using the fire buttons will barely move the Marked crosshair, while Mom's Knife will be unusable and locked to the right.}}
{{bug|dlc=nr|The [[Blindfolded]] condition also applies to the knives fired by {{i|Tammy's Head}}, and prevents it from working.}}

